            <ArticleTitle>[Diagnostic image (98). A woman with a vanished intra-uterine device].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1412</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A 36-year-old woman suffered from abdominal pain immediately after placement of an intra-uterine device (IUD). Abdominal X-ray revealed that the IUD had perforated the uterus and lay in the peritoneal cavity.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
